                                            text="&lt;p>&lt;i>The coaches of the Samaritan Association of Cham demonstrated techniques like the &amp;quot;forearm grip,&amp;quot; used to move an unconscious person.&lt;/i>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
