                                <title2_copy_copy
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1651545824678,1651545825694]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-04-14T12:29:36.238-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="We Now Know How to React Appropriately"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    type="h2"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text_copy
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2025-04-14T12:28:35.167-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-04-14T12:29:46.789-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Even though the topic was serious, and the training sessions lasted for three hours, the atmosphere was positive. The coaches interspersed stories and facts to make the exercises engaging rather than daunting. At the end of training, Isabelle remarked, “I am now much more confident that I would know how to react appropriately in an emergency. I am very grateful to AbbVie for offering this refresher training, as it's even more likely we will encounter emergencies in our private lives than during the eight hours at work.” &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
